t("The simplest of belts, worn for centuries by Nessilla Tantaelen as she tended to her people and forests. Some of her wisdom and power have settled permanently into its fibers.", "El más simple de los cinturones, usado durante siglos por Nessilla Tantaelen mientras tendía a tu gente y bosques. Algunos de tu sabiduría y poder se han instalado permanentemente en sus fibras.", "_t")
t("#DARK_GREEN#Nessilla's belt seems to come alive as you put it on.", "#DARK GREEN # El cinturón de Nessilla parece estar vivo cuando lo pusiste.", "logPlayer")
